WEBVTT

00:00:11.031 --> 00:00:12.032
(screaming)

00:00:17.579 --> 00:00:18.622
(gasps)

00:00:18.706 --> 00:00:21.500
Bad news! Somebody up there
doesn't like us.

00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:23.836
We're six minutes behind schedule!

00:00:23.919 --> 00:00:24.878
(all gasp)

00:00:24.962 --> 00:00:27.881
Double time, everyone.
We need that big crystal.

00:00:29.049 --> 00:00:30.134
(grunting)

00:00:34.138 --> 00:00:35.347
Oh. Hey, Bro-Dad!

00:00:35.431 --> 00:00:36.515
(both grunting)

00:00:36.598 --> 00:00:37.599
(Julian gasps)

00:00:38.475 --> 00:00:39.643
(screeching)

00:00:39.727 --> 00:00:40.728
(all yelping)

00:00:41.228 --> 00:00:42.229
(grunts)

00:00:46.108 --> 00:00:47.109
(both gasp)

00:00:48.318 --> 00:00:49.653
We got company!

00:00:49.737 --> 00:00:51.822
Ooh. I'll put out the sponge cake.

00:00:52.656 --> 00:00:54.658
-(screeching)
-(all screaming)

00:00:58.245 --> 00:00:59.913
BUCK: Steady.

00:00:59.997 --> 00:01:02.166
Steady. (grunts)

00:01:03.959 --> 00:01:05.335
Sorry about this.

00:01:05.419 --> 00:01:07.254
I'm really conflicted right now.

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.048
(all gasp)

00:01:10.132 --> 00:01:13.552
That's more like it, Roger. Now finish him.

00:01:13.635 --> 00:01:15.345
Wait! Wait, you don't understand.

00:01:15.429 --> 00:01:16.889
You see that?

00:01:16.972 --> 00:01:19.057
If that asteroid hits, we all die.

00:01:19.141 --> 00:01:20.726
(mocking) If it hits, we all die.

00:01:20.809 --> 00:01:21.894
(mock crying)

00:01:21.977 --> 00:01:23.103
(laughing)

00:01:23.187 --> 00:01:24.605
That's where you're wrong.

00:01:24.688 --> 00:01:26.940
See, while you run for your mammal lives,

00:01:27.024 --> 00:01:31.278
we'll be high in the sky, cruising above it all.

00:01:32.362 --> 00:01:35.491
That's the stupidest thing I've ever heard!

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.869
We'll be as safe as those little birdies.

00:01:39.536 --> 00:01:41.371
-(bird squawks)
-Lucky shot.

00:01:41.705 --> 00:01:42.748
(birds squawk)

00:01:42.831 --> 00:01:44.625
Very lucky shot?

00:01:45.292 --> 00:01:46.376
(all gasp)

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.922
I knew it. I was right. There's no paradise.

00:01:50.005 --> 00:01:53.759
What? I'm too young
to go extinct! (screams)

00:01:53.842 --> 00:01:57.471
She gets it! Now, please,
we haven't got much time!

00:01:58.388 --> 00:02:00.724
What are you waiting for? Kill him!

00:02:00.808 --> 00:02:03.393
No, Dad. I won't let you.

00:02:03.477 --> 00:02:05.813
Do you want to know
what I love about our family?

00:02:05.896 --> 00:02:07.731
That we're alive.

00:02:07.815 --> 00:02:10.609
There are more important things
than your pride right now.

00:02:10.692 --> 00:02:12.402
If you care about us,

00:02:12.486 --> 00:02:14.321
you should not kill him.

00:02:14.404 --> 00:02:16.448
You should help him, Dad.

00:02:16.532 --> 00:02:18.784
Pop, I hate to say this,

00:02:18.867 --> 00:02:21.078
but my freaky little brother may be right.

00:02:21.161 --> 00:02:24.748
As a father, I would
work with my worst enemy

00:02:24.832 --> 00:02:28.544
to ensure a brighter future for my little one.

00:02:30.754 --> 00:02:31.839
(growls softly)

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.679
Reinforcements have arrived!

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:49.398
All right, Roger. Lead the way.

00:02:51.024 --> 00:02:52.860
(mimicking helicopter)

00:02:53.277 --> 00:02:54.278
(all cheering)

00:02:54.611 --> 00:02:57.447
Oh! So that's what approval sounds like.

00:02:59.116 --> 00:03:00.534
BUCK: Keep it up, dinos.

00:03:00.617 --> 00:03:02.327
Use that Jurassic super strength!

00:03:05.706 --> 00:03:07.124
Beep, beep, beep.

00:03:13.589 --> 00:03:14.590
(gasps)

00:03:15.716 --> 00:03:17.217
Watch out, kids! (grunts)

00:03:22.472 --> 00:03:23.473
(screaming)

00:03:24.266 --> 00:03:25.267
(groaning)

00:03:26.143 --> 00:03:28.645
The weasel has landed.

00:03:29.438 --> 00:03:33.150
(gasps) I'll push it in.
Go with Peaches and Ellie!

00:03:34.818 --> 00:03:36.904
-(grunting)
-JULIAN: No!

00:03:36.987 --> 00:03:39.531
I'm not leaving you! We'll do this together!

00:03:41.158 --> 00:03:42.618
(both grunting)

00:03:44.995 --> 00:03:46.496
Mom, where are they?

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:47.915
(all gasp)

00:03:47.998 --> 00:03:51.752
Ellie, we've got to get
everyone off the volcano.

00:03:51.835 --> 00:03:54.379
Folks, I'm outta cake, but I got salami!

00:03:54.463 --> 00:03:55.547
Faster, faster!

00:03:55.631 --> 00:03:56.757
I'mouttacakebutIgotsalami!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:57.841
-Granny, come on!
-Hey! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

00:03:59.551 --> 00:04:00.636
(both grunting)

00:04:05.849 --> 00:04:08.018
This isn't working.

00:04:10.562 --> 00:04:12.606
Mad air on the half-pipe!

00:04:12.689 --> 00:04:14.733
Manny, I have a plan!

00:04:14.816 --> 00:04:16.735
We have to let the crystal go!

00:04:16.818 --> 00:04:19.321
You know we're trying to
get it in the volcano, right?

00:04:19.404 --> 00:04:23.283
Manny, the only thing I want
is a life with Peaches.

00:04:23.367 --> 00:04:25.077
And to prove myself to you.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.955
So, okay, two things. I want two things.

00:04:28.038 --> 00:04:31.208
Do you really think I'd waste
the only chance I have left?

00:04:34.169 --> 00:04:35.796
Okay, let's do it!

00:04:35.879 --> 00:04:38.131
On my count. One...

00:04:38.215 --> 00:04:39.216
Two...

00:04:39.549 --> 00:04:41.218
-Three!
-(grunts)

00:04:44.888 --> 00:04:45.889
(both grunting)

00:04:52.396 --> 00:04:54.314
What are they doing?

00:05:08.203 --> 00:05:09.204
(all gasp)

00:05:11.498 --> 00:05:13.083
Did it work?

00:05:19.548 --> 00:05:23.176
Yes! I take back everything
I ever said about you!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.012
(laughs) Wait, what?

00:05:25.095 --> 00:05:26.096
-(gasps)
-Huh?

00:05:26.638 --> 00:05:27.848
(rumbling)

00:05:28.724 --> 00:05:30.225
Now let's get out of here!

00:05:37.065 --> 00:05:38.066
(both screaming)

00:05:53.123 --> 00:05:54.374
What happened?

00:05:54.458 --> 00:05:56.960
Maybe it's the quiet before the crazy?

00:05:57.544 --> 00:05:58.754
-(steam whizzing)
-Hmm.

00:06:01.256 --> 00:06:03.258
(all gasp)

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:07.971
(both gasp)

00:06:14.478 --> 00:06:15.645
(all gasping)

00:06:24.112 --> 00:06:25.405
(yelping)

00:06:25.489 --> 00:06:26.573
Eddie!

00:06:26.656 --> 00:06:28.075
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

00:06:28.158 --> 00:06:29.159
(yelps)

00:06:39.252 --> 00:06:40.462
(all whimpering)

00:06:52.265 --> 00:06:54.684
We did it. We did it!

00:06:54.768 --> 00:06:56.436
-(all cheering)
-(Manny laughs)

00:06:58.939 --> 00:07:00.607
In your face, space rock!

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:03.026
Yeah, baby! (laughs)

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:04.778
Whoo-hoo! Yeah! Oh!

00:07:05.487 --> 00:07:06.488
(swoons)

00:07:06.947 --> 00:07:07.948
Hmm.

00:07:08.031 --> 00:07:09.950
Not on the lips, geezer!

00:07:10.033 --> 00:07:11.076
(both cheering)

00:07:11.159 --> 00:07:12.452
(cheering)
♪ Hit the road, you stupid rock ♪

00:07:12.536 --> 00:07:14.121
♪ We just stopped the doomsday clock! ♪

00:07:15.372 --> 00:07:17.916
-Yes! Yeah! Whoa!
-All right!

00:07:17.999 --> 00:07:21.044
Bring it in, Bro-Son. Welcome to the family.

00:07:21.128 --> 00:07:22.129
(chuckles)

00:07:25.549 --> 00:07:27.801
And you, you coconut!

00:07:27.884 --> 00:07:29.970
I'll never doubt you again.

00:07:30.053 --> 00:07:32.430
See? Daddy's always right.

00:07:32.514 --> 00:07:34.141
Remember that when you're older.

00:07:34.224 --> 00:07:35.308
(all cheering)

00:07:40.856 --> 00:07:42.649
Are you sure you can't come with us?

00:07:42.732 --> 00:07:45.402
Oh, Sidney, I wish I could.

00:07:45.902 --> 00:07:48.155
But we both know this is for the best.

00:07:48.238 --> 00:07:50.740
You've got your whole life in front of you.

00:07:50.824 --> 00:07:53.827
Besides, I'll have Granny
to keep me company.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.787
(gasps) You're staying, too?

00:07:55.871 --> 00:07:58.915
Are you kidding? This place is great!

00:07:58.999 --> 00:08:02.669
Tonight's the big talent show,
and tomorrow, naked bingo!

00:08:02.752 --> 00:08:03.920
You coming, Gladys?

00:08:04.004 --> 00:08:05.672
I ain't getting any younger! Whoo!

00:08:05.755 --> 00:08:07.340
What? I can't hear you!

00:08:07.424 --> 00:08:09.259
What? I can't hear you!

00:08:09.342 --> 00:08:11.595
-What? I can't hear you!
-What?

00:08:11.678 --> 00:08:14.431
You'll always be my one true love.

00:08:15.265 --> 00:08:17.184
Here.

00:08:17.267 --> 00:08:18.393
Wow!

00:08:19.394 --> 00:08:20.437
Hold on.

00:08:21.605 --> 00:08:22.606
(humming)

00:08:23.773 --> 00:08:25.108
(Brooke laughs)

00:08:25.192 --> 00:08:27.277
It looks just like you.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.404
Now we'll be with each other forever.

00:08:34.451 --> 00:08:36.036
So long, handsome!

00:08:36.119 --> 00:08:37.370
Bye, Sidney!

